I don't think there is any reason to spend more than 30
turns on the Plane of water. Bring along a reliable means of
levitation, a /oTeleport just in case, a means to detect the
original location of the portal and a /oSDD or a charged up
(BoO.

Preparation for the Astral Plane at this point should be
dropping useless stuff until you are unburdened and having a
/oLightning or /oFire in hand for the 2 arch liches that
always seem to greet me. You might want to put your (BoH
into a sack just in case you get cursed before you can get
to the ground and use one of those wands. You can do that
before you start looking for the portal.
